                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e452eb6-6bc1-3a8f-a1e9-49f3923c15e4",
                                        "entry_id": "de2cc5f4-25ba-334e-a8a8-2ea7b65a6a2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of Glock switch.",
                                            "A Glock pistol equipped with a Glock switch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "metonymically",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcc6641d-9d57-440c-adfb-2595fd74b022",
                                                "sense_id": "3e452eb6-6bc1-3a8f-a1e9-49f3923c15e4",
                                                "text": "The way that switch brrt, I know he dyin' (Oh my, oh my God). 6-7, I just bipped right on the highway (Bip, bip)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0bc5380e-fc22-3c03-9f65-3f20fe249317",
                                        "entry_id": "de2cc5f4-25ba-334e-a8a8-2ea7b65a6a2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A play in which the ball (or equivalent) is moved from one side of the playing area to the other."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54fc1ac8-78ee-41ef-a78a-28871289a391",
                                                "sense_id": "0bc5380e-fc22-3c03-9f65-3f20fe249317",
                                                "text": "Once a sign of surrender and lead protection, the backwards kick plays a role in one of the most enterprising, enjoyable phases of the modern game: the switch. In an era where zones, presses, zone-presses and floods are ever present, the switch breaks through these tactical innovations like a hot knife through butter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "235df3f2-06af-3a49-9d68-29970250425e",
                                        "entry_id": "de2cc5f4-25ba-334e-a8a8-2ea7b65a6a2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of the currently fronting headmate changing; an instance of this."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e686bdf-7f52-4616-a4b3-0243eb2dc0c3",
                                                "sense_id": "235df3f2-06af-3a49-9d68-29970250425e",
                                                "text": "Switches only happen once every couple weeks for us, but they're quite sudden when they happen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "switch",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec21d668-d730-3982-802c-02d069d7f62e",
                                        "entry_id": "1e32eb84-c81b-3961-96a2-ea7ea45531e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exchange."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de97c53-0e30-46a8-9946-335d0c289180",
                                                "sense_id": "ec21d668-d730-3982-802c-02d069d7f62e",
                                                "text": "A “moving platform” scheme[…]is more technologically ambitious than maglev trains even though it relies on conventional rails. Local trains would use side-by-side rails to roll alongside intercity trains and allow passengers to switch trains by stepping through docking bays."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39b2c2ce-2110-43bc-a34e-53370d77ed9a",
                                                "sense_id": "ec21d668-d730-3982-802c-02d069d7f62e",
                                                "text": "I want to switch this red dress for a green one."
